.TH CASTLEFRANKENSTEIN 1
.SH NAME
castlefrankenstein \- maze shooter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/castlefrankenstein
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I CastleFrankenstein
is a maze shooter.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Walk and turn in a grid maze and fire when monsters are in line of sight. Clear the map as quickly as you can.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Up / w
Move forward
.TP
.B Down / s
Move back
.TP
.B Left / a
Turn left
.TP
.B Right / d
Turn right
.TP
.B space
Fire
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/castlefrankenstein.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
